NAME
    ps - report current application processes

SYNOPSIS
    ps

DESCRIPTION
    Prints the bounded kernel process registry, including stable process IDs,
    launcher origin, lifecycle state, charged user CPU time, retained pages,
    live handles, timer-driven preemptions, voluntary yields, and executable
    name. PREEMPTS counts resumable timeslice expiries and YIELDS counts
    voluntary returns to the scheduler; together they show how often a process
    left unprivileged execution. Observation is read-only and does not expose
    command arguments or process-control authority.
